WEBVTT

00:01.891 --> 00:02.808
It's a king of music.

00:22.862 --> 00:27.025
I saw the static in your eyes, the silent

00:27.065 --> 00:33.089
screams, the practiced lies.

00:33.530 --> 00:37.713
A pained smile, a hollow shell, trapped inside a

00:37.773 --> 00:39.294
private hell.

00:43.649 --> 00:51.698
You couldn't hear my quiet plea, but you are

00:51.758 --> 00:54.962
finally back with me.

00:56.223 --> 01:02.240
And I will never let you go again. And this is a

01:02.300 --> 01:09.063
promise not a warning for when If the darkness

01:09.223 --> 01:12.924
ever calls your name I'll be the fire, I'll be the

01:12.984 --> 01:15.524
flame And if I have to

01:21.662 --> 01:26.209
With my own two hands

01:26.849 --> 01:33.419
I'll drag you back from those broken lands

02:04.259 --> 02:07.623
I'll be the flute song in your head for every

02:07.763 --> 02:10.926
single word unsaid

02:14.850 --> 02:18.995
A steady note, a gentle sound on this new and

02:19.095 --> 02:20.116
solid ground

02:24.098 --> 02:28.346
No more silence, no more fear As long as I am

02:28.366 --> 02:32.112
standing here You'll never have to walk alone

02:32.233 --> 02:35.118
I'll bring my broken brother home

02:38.061 --> 02:44.345
I will never let you go again This is a promise,

02:44.505 --> 02:51.429
not a word if or when If the darkness ever calls

02:51.469 --> 02:59.153
your name I'll be the fire, I'll be the flame And

02:59.213 --> 03:07.565
if I have to With my own two hands,

03:08.186 --> 03:14.750
I'll drag you back from those broken lands.

